Change(genesis='66602cd0dec37d58d03eec9518ca805a7ac38ea912d2b0c366a0b67b4b9f50b6', deps=(), event=Decided(decision='onequery', at=datetime(2026, 9, 7, 0, 0, 0), actor='assistant', title='One todo as the folds see it is one query, prodrome_core::view', body="*One todo as the folds see it is one query* (SPEC §6.7, `prodrome_core::view`, 2026-09-07): the confirmed registers for lifecycle, content and conflicts; the registers under the empty policy for what an untrusted actor has CLAIMED and not bound; `flatten` for the function and `fulfillment` for its value. A composition of §6 and §7, not a fifth fold, in the core so the server and the browser's offline fold are the SAME reading (ARCHITECTURE §4). An entry carries the NAMES of its candidate content objects and its function as a PRINT, which the caller holding the objects looks up. SPEC §9.9 is the law.", rationale='Decided 2026-09-07 (SPEC §6.7, §9.9).', supersedes=()))